-- The engine room (ours, after the book's floor plan, p. 83): the ring of cooling corridors round the locked
-- central engine hall, the entrance from the south, storage to the south-east, fruit stalls and the noodle stand to
-- the west, the self-selling AIs to the east, and Roy's office, locked, to the north.

